
Fact output
    Identified by String

Placeholder derived-output For output

Fact produced-output
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * derived-output * job

Fact output-release-approved
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * derived-output * intended-purpose * job

Fact output-released
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * derived-output * intended-purpose * job

Fact output-release-eligible
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * derived-output * intended-purpose * job
    Holds when admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && produced-output(
            compute-provider, resource, derived-output, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)
        && authorised-purpose(
            provider, resource, intended-purpose)
        && session-purpose(job, intended-purpose)

Act register-output
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, derived-output, intended-purpose, job
    Creates produced-output(
        compute-provider, resource, derived-output, job)
    Holds when admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)
        && session-purpose(job, intended-purpose)

Act approve-release
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, derived-output, intended-purpose, job
    Creates output-release-approved(
        provider, compute-provider, resource,
        derived-output, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when output-release-eligible(
        provider, compute-provider, resource,
        derived-output, intended-purpose, job)

Act release-output
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, derived-output, intended-purpose, job
    Creates output-released(
        compute-provider, resource,
        derived-output, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when output-release-eligible(
        provider, compute-provider, resource,
        derived-output, intended-purpose, job)
        && output-release-approved(
            provider, compute-provider, resource,
            derived-output, intended-purpose, job)
